ohc=diqYkK9iei8Q7kNvwGUGZA5&_nc_oc=AdqUNnWIV_sRNjkUBjFz4pvrXvnKUT1iDi39qnZd4J7S2O8wAm65X9ZnoRA1gshjuYo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQN9E5R8HDOClMh8-DnZndKhrl34AHzVO3q3ESjDxZ6dzQ&oe=6ADCADA8"}, {"file_name": "Frame 9 (6).png", "id": "1839870786628509", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825503_1839870789961842_3439604357024733203_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yto2AfWJ8G0Q7kNvwETwo6-&_nc_oc=AdqQimoU5QEYX2zHvOPyJeeo5f3BL2pN4cFYEy7l06t_EQUqMEtGOTTXDXCgyKgDV6U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMA7oRrgMfb-K3bneZq8TeK8OjIreuVT__9mXcgxvm_BA&oe=6ADCC303"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Stuff: Horror", "keywords": ["Horror", "Sandbox", "Backrooms", "Liminal", "Multiplayer"], "long_description": "# \ud83d\udd79\ufe0f Stuff **Multiplayer Horror Action**\n\n# \ud83d\udc80 Beware the Monsters\nHorrifying creatures lurk around every corner. Run, hide, or fight \u2014 the choice\nis yours.\n# \u2694\ufe0f PvP and Weapon Collection\nEvery battle is a chance to prove who the true survivor is.\n{868646472513144}\n\n# \ud83e\uddf0 Explore and Interact\nDiscover and use 40+ unique items \u2014 from tools to rare artifacts that can save your life or change the course of the game.\n# \ud83c\udfae Play Together\nTeam up with friends or survive alone \u2014 your fate depends on your decisions.\n{821277124055890}", "short_description": "\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f Stuff\nDive into a world of fear and survival!\nExplore a vast map, collect valuable items, and trade them for in-game currency. Run from terrifying monsters or team up with friends to stay alive.\nDiscover 4+ unique locations \u2014 warehouses, sewers, and caves \u2014 over 40 interactive items, and 20+ weapons for intense PvP battles. Prove you can survive the night!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://doc-hosting.flycricket.io/stuff-horror/8d6ccc